# --------------------------------------------------
# Ignore list for markdownlint.
#
# This file lists files and patterns that should
# be ignored by the markdownlint CLI.
#
# The markdownlint CLI uses .markdownlintignore
# from the directory where it is run.
#
# The markdownlint VS Code extension uses markdownlint.lintWorkspaceGlobs
# for workspace linting. Open files can still be linted even when
# they are ignored by this file.
# --------------------------------------------------

# Ignore dependency directories
**/node_modules/**
**/coverage/**
**/dist/**

# Changelog is generated by semantic-release
**/CHANGELOG.md
